r, so they have the location going for them also. I like supporting smaller, local businesses. Thanks, Mary!"},{"business_id":"EYh3aE3mqmQ3k9Laznc58A","review_id":"jZexh-_KFWBMhtrzEsyhXw","date":"2014-04-15T21:45:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9119173288345337,"text_excerpt":"This store is the best! It has everything you need from a mop to specific household hardware. You can also get key copies here for $1.99 each which is a steal for the French quarter. This is my go to store since I live in the fq. They also have a customer parking lot which is so helpful. I just discovered there is an entire kitchen and bath section upstairs. I can't wait to go back to check it out."},{"business_id":"EYh3aE3mqmQ3k9Laznc58A","review_id":"iEEM8c6yDhjxW3-Ko5ZZog","date":"2009-01-29T15:00:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9104305505752563,"text_excerpt":"As the houses of the Quarter are broken up into condo's that become empty vacation homes and the guy who owns the T-Shirt shops works on his dreram of owning every square foot of retail space in the Quarter for his schlock empire, it's always good to see a hardy, useful, local store that isn't going anywhere. Mary's is everything you need in a hardware store, and helpful too. I had to rig a non-fitting back rack complete with ribbons and decorations onto a bike for a customers wedding last year...we had 1/2 hour and the brides maids were nervous...one of the workers spent the whole 30 minutes opening up different fasteners to get it done...and did in the nick of time. That's the kind of t..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
